                    {
                        "sense_id": "0d018fd2-50e3-3983-a4ca-5d94550634bb",
                        "entry_id": "c6ed405d-1015-37b5-bcea-5920f07d3adc",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne qui est la première à agir, à intervenir."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "41e8e8ad-7b43-4208-a787-4e3af3f597f3",
                                "sense_id": "0d018fd2-50e3-3983-a4ca-5d94550634bb",
                                "text": "Nous avons créé l’état-major opérationnel de prévention du terrorisme, le fichier de signalement des personnes radicalisées à caractère terroriste qui permet un meilleur suivi des individus radicalisés, mis en place un nouveau schéma national d’intervention des forces spécialisées, modernisé le matériel des primo-intervenants – brigade anticriminalité et peloton de surveillance et d’intervention de la gendarmerie – en cas de tuerie de masse. Soutenir que nous ne mettrions pas tout en œuvre en raison d’une supposée désinvolture est aussi irresponsable qu’inacceptable."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7fe97436-a78c-44f0-a1c5-1f4f5725eecc",
                        "source_entry_id": "c6ed405d-1015-37b5-bcea-5920f07d3adc",
                        "source_sense_id": "0d018fd2-50e3-3983-a4ca-5d94550634bb",
                        "target_lang_word": "first responder",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "first responder",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "023b3208-d920-3966-8b1b-14b6c175385a",
                                        "entry_id": "d06562bd-9a60-37cb-b460-bf1660168311",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of an emergency service who is first on the scene, or among those first on the scene, at an emergency."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Australia",
                                            "Canada",
                                            "US"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d605da1a-da16-4633-b50a-c3790fe14608",
                                                "sense_id": "023b3208-d920-3966-8b1b-14b6c175385a",
                                                "text": "Many survivors tried to describe what they felt, but words failed them. Hard to imagine, too, the emotions of the first responders – the ambulance crews, the medics and the police – faced by ghastly mayhem. It must have felt overwhelming, but they did their jobs and doubtless saved many lives."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "14e16d23-fee4-4829-b92c-ea058de2b606",
                                                "sense_id": "023b3208-d920-3966-8b1b-14b6c175385a",
                                                "text": "At the same time the hazard warning lights and, once the vehicle has come to a standstill, the Mercedes-Benz emergency call system is activated and the doors and windows are unlocked, to make access to the interior easier for any first responders."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b25d8fd2-5639-45e1-8359-10865e77cdd6",
                                                "sense_id": "023b3208-d920-3966-8b1b-14b6c175385a",
                                                "text": "In July, the New Taipei city government organized a large-scale drill with its disaster services and the Defense Ministry. Included for the first time was urban warfare, such as how first responders would react to an attack on a train station or a port."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "666f19fc-3b56-3bc9-9c1e-13c639016824",
                                        "entry_id": "d06562bd-9a60-37cb-b460-bf1660168311",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of an emergency service trained to provide emergency medical care."
                                        ],
